    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"FactoryMethod.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>FactoryMethod</code></a> from the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Constructor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Constructor</code></a> and <a href=\"Parameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>Parameter</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "根据给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Constructor.html\" title=\"类或接口 java.lang.reflect\"><code>Constructor</code></a>和<a href=\"Parameter.html\" title=\"类 org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>Parameter</code></a>s，创建一个新的<a href=\"FactoryMethod.html\" title=\"类 org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>FactoryMethod</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the underlying <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Constructor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Constructor</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回底层<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Constructor.html\" title=\"java.lang.reflect 中的类或接口\"><code>Constructor</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"Parameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>Parameter</code></a>s of the executable.",
      "translation": "返回可执行对象的<a href=\"Parameter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的类\"><code>Parameter</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the given <a href=\"PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> is referenced in a creator argument of the\n<a href=\"PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> backing this <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/InstanceCreatorMetadataSupport.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>InstanceCreatorMetadataSupport</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回给定的 <a href=\"PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> 是否被引用在支持此 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/InstanceCreatorMetadataSupport.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>InstanceCreatorMetadataSupport</code></a> 的 <a href=\"PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> 的创建者参数中。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Results of this call are cached and reused on the next invocation. Calling this method for a\n<a href=\"PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> that was not yet added to its owning <a href=\"PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> will capture that state\nand return the same result after adding <a href=\"PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> to its entity.",
      "translation": "本次调用的结果会被缓存并在下一次调用时复用。如果对一个尚未添加到其所属的<a href=\"PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> 中的<a href=\"PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> 调用此方法，将捕获该状态；在将该<a href=\"PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> 添加到其所属实体后，将返回相同的结果。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
